'''Ghoulish''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by purchasing Roblox’s [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/14701843575/Mask-of-Ghoulish-Despair Mask of Ghoulish Despair] hat and then joining [[Murder Mystery 2]] during the [[Halloween Event 2023]] before November 3rd or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Its blade has a black base with a smoky white ghoulish aura over it, hence the name. The guard and handle are both solid black.

==Trivia==
*This is the second knife to be obtained by owning an exclusive Roblox item, the first being [[Ghostly (Knife)|Ghostly]].
*This knife was initially called "PGSH" for an unknown reason when it first released. However, this has since been corrected.

